(7279437, 1133865, 6519, '<td valign="top">There is SO much about this image that I don''t like - the lean, the lack of focus, the blown highlights, the too-dark shadows, the very odd composition, etc etc etc.<br/> <br/>And yet, for this challenge, it all came together as a success: it creeps me out!!!!<br/> <br/>It is unsettling and even scary - for a Halloween challenge, this is great!</td>', 'There is SO much about this image that I don''t like - the lean, the lack of focus, the blown highlights, the too-dark shadows, the very odd composition, etc etc etc. And yet, for this challenge, it all came together as a success: it creeps me out!!!! It is unsettling and even scary - for a Halloween challenge, this is great!', '2014-11-03 00:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
