(7279550, 1134203, 114225, '<td valign="top">A couple tips for improvement:<br/>1. Get down lower. Look them in the eye instead of looking down on them<br/>2. Avoid the on camera flash if possible<br/>3. Crop tighter to get rid of distracting eleements</td>', 'A couple tips for improvement:1. Get down lower. Look them in the eye instead of looking down on them2. Avoid the on camera flash if possible3. Crop tighter to get rid of distracting eleements', '2014-11-03 10:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
